      },
      "persona": "Blackhat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Reyes Calloway:</b> Every snapshot in that archive is dated, and the archive is filed by capture number, so the page will not do the work for you. Lay the events out in the order they actually happened and you can see the exact moment this stopped being anybody's job. That moment is the finding.",
      "taskInstructions": "Every slot has to be filled before CHECK ORDER will grade the board. Correct positions lock in place, wrong ones drop back to the pool, and the third failed check locks the console out.",
      "taskQuestion": "Reconstruct the BridgeWorks portal timeline.",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Reyes Calloway:</b> The dated captures prove continued publication after dissolution, not that either username still authenticates."
